Root cause:
The bug was caused by the incorrect usage of the `groupSort` variable in the `TopGroupsResultTransformer` class, which was not properly referencing the intended sorting criteria for grouped results. This led to incorrect sorting behavior when the `group.sort` option was specified in queries.

Code statements information:
